== F-THEORY lesson 530137d5-9e19-46b7-9751-638779afa108 topic Perimeter of rectangles, squares and polygons
 t1 [pehle theory batao] move=hook sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Perimeter
     "Perimeter yani kisi shape ki boundary ki total length; shape ke sabhi sides jodte hain. Aap ise fence ya lace jaisa sochiye—boundary ke chaaron taraf. Ab aap batayiye: perimeter mein kaunsi sides jodenge?"
 t2 [haan] move=explain sheet=false HELPLINE=false tray=studio+visual topic=Perimeter
     "Kabir, perimeter nikalne ke liye polygon ki har side ki length ek-ek karke jodiye. Aapke hisaab se rectangle ki kaunsi sides jodenge?"
    [t1] TURN 1 move=hook    [t1] safety distress=false
    [t2] TURN 2 move=explain    [t2] safety distress=false
